{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261022/photo/bkn-20261022024529019-1022_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261022033649\"/><p>事發在沙嶺道。</p><p>昨日(21日)下午2時46分，打鼓嶺沙嶺道一村屋姓葉(47歲)男住戶報案，指在上址外與4名男子爭執，期間葉男曾揮舞一把平鑿。警員接報到場，在葉男身上檢獲一把平鑿。經初步調查，他涉嫌「藏有攻擊性武器」被捕，現正被扣留調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T19:41:06.876548+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T18:45:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T21:38:11.376942+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T19:37:38.096469+00:00","content_hash":"6c073101a8e707111bbebefd5121ba27d6c5e91dede9e48c21a5027c964960a9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}